function vase(group,x,z,h,r,m){const pts=[];for(let i=0;i<13;i++){const t=i/12,rr=r*(.6+.43*Math.sin(t*Math.PI)-.26*Math.exp(-Math.pow((t-.85)*6,2)));pts.push(new THREE.Vector2(rr,h*t));}const a=addMesh(group,new THREE.LatheGeometry(pts,28),m,x,0,z);a.material.side=THREE.DoubleSide;return a;}
function plant(group,x,z,h=.9,r=.3,m=woodMaterial){cylinder(group,r*.77,r*.65,h*.27,m,x,h*.135,z);const stem=mat('#7e7555',.9),leaf=mat('#6a7855',.94);cylinder(group,.013,.03,h*.74,stem,x,h*.63,z);for(let i=0;i<10;i++){const angle=i*2.4,height=h*(.45+i*.047),q=ellipsoid(group,h*.30,.035,h*.10,leaf,x+Math.sin(angle)*h*.12,height,z+Math.cos(angle)*h*.12);q.rotation.y=angle;q.rotation.z=Math.sin(angle)*.4;}}
